{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2021-09", "window": 1, "start_date": 1630454400, "end_date": 1633046399, "month_true_total": 14, "quota": 14, "returned": 14, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:53:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "100196159", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046869764", "personaname": "Salt", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nicnactt/", "num_games_owned": 16, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1238, "last_played": 1634491330, "avatar": "cd4157d04df12423a05cf2107a9d9143cd7ad182"}, "language": "english", "review": "There's a certain satisfaction in shooting starchild in the face", "timestamp_created": 1632965563, "timestamp_updated": 1632965563, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100013520", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018815016", "personaname": "Woundheir", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WoundheirX/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1791, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 991, "last_played": 1633121625, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I haven't finished Mass Effect 3 yet, but its one of the most annoying games I've ever played. First of all all of the dialogue options are on the citadel. Slight annoyance, but why do I have to leave the ship every time I want to talk to someone on the ship? Second, and worst, side missions you get a ton of. However, they don't have any progress update & the only way to complete them is to just scan everything possible & hope you get them. Or on a specific mission. And you have no way of knowing if you got them until you stumble across the turn in at the citadel. A lot of those side missions you can't complete until way later as well, and they just sit in the mission log alongside ones you can complete. \n\nThe graphics are varied from breathtaking views or models to pixelated messes. Zooming in on rifles is usually blurry for no reason as well.", "timestamp_created": 1632691190, "timestamp_updated": 1632691190, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.469686627388000488", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "100004639", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110549411", "personaname": "zehawk", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zehawk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1358, "last_played": 1632678436, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Piece of crap. I hate these stupid games and their annoying boss fights which suddenly ratchet up the difficult 100x the normal.", "timestamp_created": 1632678515, "timestamp_updated": 1632678515, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.359408020973205566", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99970671", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984806691", "personaname": "Wry", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WRYYYYYYY/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 97, "playtime_forever": 16, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playt