ce. I am intrigued to see what the developers do from here.", "timestamp_created": 1631431206, "timestamp_updated": 1631431206, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98962286", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074292567", "personaname": "Dain'jer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198074292567/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 4881, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 216, "last_played": 1641347658, "avatar": "0c3c06f35b2e2341479c31434547c6ac495d0538"}, "language": "english", "review": "Soooo good. Combat system is even better. loving it so far", "timestamp_created": 1631057969, "timestamp_updated": 1631057969, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98884109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198052542014", "personaname": "Napeun", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198052542014/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 11671, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11275, "last_played": 1635901659, "avatar": "ab53f8973d1418be02505084e2d26ca7aee7596e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still good, and the end still bad anyway", "timestamp_created": 1630936077, "timestamp_updated": 1630936077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 